From: Yash-Awasthi <yashawasthi12032006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:36:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Move the attention recognizer into the middle end

It runs at -O2 on any target with the new attn optab and emits IFN_ATTN; -mattn-recognize is gone and errno from expf no longer blocks it.
